
# 🔌 Pin Connections

## Arduino Uno ↔ DHT11 Sensor

| DHT11 Pin | Arduino Uno Pin |
|------------|-----------------|
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |
| DATA | D2 |

---

## Arduino Uno ↔ 16×2 I2C LCD

| LCD Pin | Arduino Uno Pin |
|----------|-----------------|
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |
| SDA | A4 |
| SCL | A5 |

---

## 📋 Complete Connection Summary

| Arduino Pin | Connected To |
|--------------|--------------|
| 5V | DHT11 VCC, LCD VCC |
| GND | DHT11 GND, LCD GND |
| D2 | DHT11 DATA |
| A4 | LCD SDA |
| A5 | LCD SCL |

---

## 📌 Components Used in Connections

- Arduino Uno
- DHT11 Temperature & Humidity Sensor
- 16×2 I2C LCD Display
- Breadboard
- Jumper Wires
- USB Cable